# Reuse, not stubs

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

- Prefer `third_party/` pins, wadamesh `lib_deps` (e.g. ArduinoJson), or known
  open-source over naive homemade parsers/servers.
- **Share inside the firmware:** put duplicated helpers in
  `firmware/tdeck-plus/common/` (`http_fetch`, `http_download`, …); do not
  paste the same TLS/redirect/URL loop into each app.
- Apps must be real (no empty launches / fake success).
- Engines: submodule + patch + thin host — do not vendor into `firmware/`.
- Do not hand-roll JSON when ArduinoJson is available.
- Patches: no pure-format diffs.
